WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.000 --> 01:43.951
=Episode 3=

02:05.384 --> 02:06.145
Perfect timing.

02:08.704 --> 02:09.625
Okay, you go ahead.

02:09.785 --> 02:10.065
Thanks.

02:10.065 --> 02:11.185
Mr. Gao, Mrs. Gao.

02:11.345 --> 02:11.984
Wanjun.

02:12.305 --> 02:12.945
Wanjun.

02:13.465 --> 02:14.305
Thank you.

02:15.104 --> 02:16.104
You're welcome.

02:16.104 --> 02:17.424
Mrs. Gao, don't mention it.

02:17.864 --> 02:19.704
My father just got off the plane

02:19.704 --> 02:20.905
and couldn't make it in time.

02:21.264 --> 02:23.424
He asked me
to send his blessings to you.

02:24.305 --> 02:26.625
Look how thoughtful Wanjun is.

02:26.625 --> 02:27.225
Exactly.

02:27.424 --> 02:28.584
Let me tell you something.

02:29.144 --> 02:30.704
I couldn't acquire

02:30.704 --> 02:33.984
the necklace around your neck
without her help.

02:33.984 --> 02:34.505
Really?

02:34.505 --> 02:35.305
Mr. Gao.

02:35.305 --> 02:36.424
You're too kind.

02:36.544 --> 02:37.664
I'm glad you like it.

02:38.584 --> 02:39.704
I do like it.

02:42.345 --> 02:45.465
You two have been married for 30 years
and are still so loving.

02:45.785 --> 02:47.225
It's truly enviable.

02:50.185 --> 02:54.584
I wish I could find someone like Haiming

02:55.025 --> 02:56.264
in the future.

02:59.144 --> 03:01.225
H-Haiming.

03:02.864 --> 03:03.424
Come here.

03:03.625 --> 03:04.104
Excuse me.

03:05.264 --> 03:06.225
Haiming.

03:06.625 --> 03:07.144
Miss Xie.

03:07.465 --> 03:09.864
Haiming, I know
you're quite busy with work.

03:10.065 --> 03:11.424
But at least balance work and life.

03:12.025 --> 03:14.984
When you're available,
you could give Wanjun a call.

03:14.984 --> 03:16.505
You two grew up together,

03:16.785 --> 03:18.745
so you could have a meal,

03:18.864 --> 03:19.785
take a walk,

03:20.104 --> 03:21.185
or watch a movie.

03:21.384 --> 03:23.465
And you could call him as well.

03:23.584 --> 03:24.104
Right?

03:27.584 --> 03:29.505
Miss Xie, you are so outstanding,

03:29.505 --> 03:31.424
and will surely meet someone
who appreciates you.

03:32.144 --> 03:34.664
Maybe I've already met that person now.

03:35.465 --> 03:36.305
Bless you then.

03:40.305 --> 03:45.785
I-I wonder if our Haiming
can be that lucky one in your eyes.

03:46.785 --> 03:47.625
Mr. Gao.

03:47.824 --> 03:49.225
Don't be so pushy.

03:49.984 --> 03:51.144
Wanjun is outstanding.

03:51.785 --> 03:54.065
There must be many talented young men
pursuing her.

03:54.905 --> 03:56.785
Our Haiming might not
even make the list.

04:06.065 --> 04:07.065
Wanjun, here.

04:08.625 --> 04:09.144
Here.

04:09.584 --> 04:11.704
Feel free to visit anytime, okay?

04:11.704 --> 04:12.225
Okay.

04:42.584 --> 04:44.105
What did you mean just now?

04:45.745 --> 04:47.545
I wanted to ask you the same thing.

04:48.185 --> 04:51.024
You introduced many girlfriends
to Haiming before, right?

04:51.224 --> 04:52.224
Yet he likes no one.

04:53.584 --> 04:56.584
Now Miss Xie is showing
so much interest in Haiming.

04:56.865 --> 04:58.105
This is an opportunity.

04:58.384 --> 05:01.985
The Xie family's Fuchuang Company
can help us open up the northern market.

05:02.144 --> 05:04.784
This is the best chance for your son
to expand his business.

05:05.264 --> 05:06.425
Best chance for my son?

05:07.985 --> 05:09.545
(I never expected)

05:09.584 --> 05:12.305
(relationships are still complicated
even in the fiction world.)

05:12.305 --> 05:13.185
In your eyes,

05:13.904 --> 05:15.105
as long as the price is right,

05:16.065 --> 05:17.945
you can even sell your son, right?

05:18.545 --> 05:20.425
What are you talking about?

05:20.425 --> 05:22.305
I'm his birth father.

05:22.704 --> 05:24.105
Would I ever harm him?

05:24.305 --> 05:25.264
Don't you see?

05:25.904 --> 05:28.464
Haiming doesn't like
that girl named Xie Wanjun.

05:28.704 --> 05:30.264
Is it that important?

05:30.264 --> 05:31.024
Of course.

05:31.425 --> 05:33.105
Haiming's future is what matters most.

05:33.464 --> 05:35.425
- His future.
- Do you really care?

05:35.425 --> 05:37.185
(Again with this cliched plot.)

05:37.425 --> 05:38.224
Let me tell you.

05:38.584 --> 05:39.704
Haiming is my son.

05:40.784 --> 05:42.745
No one can force him
into doing anything.

05:45.464 --> 05:46.144
Let me tell you.

05:46.144 --> 05:48.224
You're really ridiculous.

05:48.545 --> 05:49.945
Use your brain and think it over.

05:56.665 --> 05:57.505
Why are you here?

06:01.464 --> 06:02.545
Mr. Xie should be here.

06:03.865 --> 06:04.665
Let's go over.

06:04.665 --> 06:05.264
Chairman.

06:06.105 --> 06:07.985
I have things to do.
I need to leave now.

06:09.185 --> 06:10.865
You have to leave now?

06:11.105 --> 06:12.584
Then why did you even come today?

06:13.144 --> 06:14.384
You and your mom,

06:14.985 --> 06:16.904
are you two set on opposing me today?

06:21.105 --> 06:23.425
Mom, how about I take you back?

06:24.464 --> 06:26.784
Gao Haiming, I'll ask you one last time.

06:26.784 --> 06:28.185
I said Mr. Xie is here.

06:28.464 --> 06:30.024
Are you going or not?

06:30.024 --> 06:30.904
Don't pressure him.

06:31.505 --> 06:32.105
Forget it, Mom.

06:32.824 --> 06:33.745
You go first.

06:35.464 --> 06:35.985
It's fine.

06:37.105 --> 06:37.704
It's fine.

06:41.985 --> 06:42.952
I'll go to the restroom.

06:44.784 --> 06:45.305
(Leave!)

06:47.264 --> 06:47.904
Gao Haiming.

06:51.065 --> 06:54.425
You've basically met
all those suitable heiresses,

06:55.144 --> 06:56.824
but you show no interest.

06:57.264 --> 06:58.185
Well, in that case,

06:58.185 --> 06:59.505
I'll make a decision for you.

06:59.865 --> 07:02.625
Miss Xie is your best choice.

07:04.545 --> 07:06.464
Just because
she's the heiress of Fuchuang?

07:08.625 --> 07:09.985
So what?

07:10.384 --> 07:12.384
Every decision I made is for you.

07:12.784 --> 07:14.505
Career always comes first for a man.

07:15.185 --> 07:16.824
Don't be ungrateful.

07:17.784 --> 07:20.384
Making me lose my patience
won't benefit you.

07:22.704 --> 07:23.824
I'll wait in the lobby.

07:24.745 --> 07:26.264
Don't embarrass me and your mom.

07:37.185 --> 07:38.945
(Such a domineering father!)

07:46.865 --> 07:48.185
Today's your event.

07:48.185 --> 07:49.024
Why are you so late?

07:49.144 --> 07:50.505
This is my event.

07:51.264 --> 07:53.464
I ran into some friends

07:53.464 --> 07:54.464
and chatted with them.

07:54.625 --> 07:55.745
That's the furniture seller.

08:07.344 --> 08:07.904
Thank you.

08:10.665 --> 08:11.545
Haiming.

08:13.144 --> 08:14.425
Where were you just now?

08:14.425 --> 08:15.584
I've been looking for you.

08:16.425 --> 08:17.264
I got held up.

08:18.704 --> 08:20.144
What a perfect match.

08:21.105 --> 08:21.865
Haiming.

08:22.105 --> 08:23.344
What's your plan tomorrow?

08:24.105 --> 08:25.065
Busy tomorrow.

08:25.824 --> 08:26.745
The day after tomorrow?

08:27.945 --> 08:28.945
Also busy then.

08:30.665 --> 08:32.265
Then are you free three days from now?

08:32.504 --> 08:33.224
Well,

08:33.665 --> 08:34.584
still busy.

08:35.545 --> 08:37.224
How are you always so busy?

08:38.185 --> 08:40.040
I'll check out wedding dress
with a friend.

08:40.360 --> 08:41.785
I want you to come with me.

08:41.785 --> 08:42.425
Miss Xie.

08:42.945 --> 08:43.864
Take a day off,

08:43.864 --> 08:44.624
Haiming.

08:45.385 --> 08:46.425
Just take one day off.

08:46.425 --> 08:47.425
Just take one day off.

08:47.425 --> 08:48.425
- Wait, Miss Xie, you...
- Haiming.

08:48.425 --> 08:49.905
I want you to come with me.

08:50.185 --> 08:51.104
Please.

08:51.104 --> 08:52.305
- Miss Xie.
- Haiming.

08:52.344 --> 08:53.665
- Miss Xie.
- Please.

08:53.665 --> 08:54.824
- Come with me.
- Miss Xie.

08:54.824 --> 08:55.464
Haiming.

08:55.624 --> 08:56.824
Please.

08:56.824 --> 08:58.065
- Please.
- Please.

08:58.065 --> 08:59.145
- Come with me.
- Come with me.

08:59.145 --> 09:00.425
- Haiming.
- Haiming.

09:00.425 --> 09:01.864
- Please.
- Please.

09:01.864 --> 09:03.785
- Come on, Haiming.
- Come on, Haiming.

09:03.785 --> 09:04.785
Let's go together.

09:04.785 --> 09:06.025
Where are you two going?

09:09.265 --> 09:09.945
Who are you?

09:11.905 --> 09:12.665
Haiming.

09:13.224 --> 09:14.744
Aren't you going to introduce me?

09:19.665 --> 09:21.425
This is Miss Lin, Lin Huan'er.

09:22.305 --> 09:23.744
Do you know that girl?

09:23.744 --> 09:24.744
Come on! Let's drink.

09:25.065 --> 09:26.464
You must be Miss Xie.

09:27.065 --> 09:27.824
Hello.

09:29.785 --> 09:30.624
Haiming.

09:31.545 --> 09:34.624
You seem quite close to Miss Lin.

09:36.265 --> 09:37.945
Kind of close.

09:41.665 --> 09:43.185
Want to leave here?

09:44.385 --> 09:45.665
What are you trying to do?

09:49.504 --> 09:51.864
Miss Lin, we're in public.

09:52.104 --> 09:53.025
Please behave.

09:54.545 --> 09:55.185
Pardon me?

09:55.665 --> 09:56.385
I said,

09:56.984 --> 09:58.344
please behave.

10:01.984 --> 10:03.385
Why did you push me?

10:04.744 --> 10:05.224
I...

10:05.785 --> 10:06.584
How clumsy.

10:06.584 --> 10:08.385
Haiming, I didn't push her.

10:08.945 --> 10:09.984
Wanjun, are you okay?

10:09.984 --> 10:10.545
Take this.

10:11.185 --> 10:11.704
What's wrong?

10:11.704 --> 10:12.344
What happened?

10:12.905 --> 10:14.464
- Mr. Gao.
- Mr. Gao.

10:14.464 --> 10:15.785
She didn't mean to.

10:16.945 --> 10:18.065
It was all my fault.

10:21.265 --> 10:22.104
What do you mean?

10:23.265 --> 10:24.584
Wait, hold on.

10:25.665 --> 10:26.624
Who are you?

10:27.824 --> 10:28.344
Haiming.

10:28.665 --> 10:30.265
Look, your suit is stained.

10:30.425 --> 10:31.545
Go clean up.

10:31.545 --> 10:32.065
Right.

10:33.385 --> 10:35.224
I should accompany Haiming
to clean it up.

10:35.224 --> 10:35.905
Excuse us.

10:36.945 --> 10:37.824
I'll go clean up.

10:39.305 --> 10:40.265
Who are you?

10:41.344 --> 10:42.104
Mr. Gao.

10:42.624 --> 10:44.145
Did you know her?

10:44.344 --> 10:45.905
Wait, why did she know me?

10:45.905 --> 10:46.785
Who is she?

10:47.704 --> 10:48.545
Who is she?

10:50.265 --> 10:51.185
I remember now.

10:51.665 --> 10:54.545
I think I saw her
at the company meeting.

10:54.545 --> 10:57.984
She must be a new employee
the company just hired.

10:58.224 --> 11:00.545
Probably a new secretary Haiming hired.

11:00.545 --> 11:02.665
Why would Haiming
hire a secretary like that?

11:02.665 --> 11:03.624
She acted recklessly.

11:03.624 --> 11:04.265
Exactly.

11:04.265 --> 11:04.864
Mr. Gao.

11:05.385 --> 11:06.425
Fire her.

11:06.984 --> 11:07.704
Alright.

11:07.704 --> 11:09.584
I will take care of it right away.

11:10.265 --> 11:10.984
Cheer up.

11:12.504 --> 11:13.984
She is so adorable.

11:17.864 --> 11:18.344
Enough.

11:21.025 --> 11:21.744
Why are you here?

11:22.504 --> 11:23.824
To ask you to let me join Letao.

11:24.905 --> 11:26.145
Why investigate me?

11:27.104 --> 11:28.385
I'll tell you if you hire me.

11:37.545 --> 11:38.104
Where are you?

11:38.984 --> 11:40.624
Mr. Gao, I just went to refuel.

11:40.624 --> 11:41.665
And I have a traffic jam.

11:41.864 --> 11:43.824
It'll take 20 minutes to get to you.

11:43.945 --> 11:44.545
Try your best.

11:48.224 --> 11:50.744
It's the weekend,
so traffic must be heavy.

11:51.984 --> 11:53.624
If you took a car back,

11:53.704 --> 11:54.905
you would get home late.

11:55.665 --> 11:58.065
Then you would have no time
to assemble your airplane model.

12:00.905 --> 12:02.824
How did you know
I assemble models at this time?

12:03.584 --> 12:04.864
(It was mentioned in the book.)

12:05.145 --> 12:07.545
(Gao Haiming assembles models
whenever he's upset.)

12:07.905 --> 12:10.704
It doesn't matter.
Want to get home in 20 minutes?

12:16.464 --> 12:17.145
Take my ride.

12:25.545 --> 12:28.265
As a big boss who is

12:28.545 --> 12:29.984
so wealthy and handsome,

12:29.984 --> 12:31.425
you would have this kind of problem.

12:32.545 --> 12:33.224
Miss Lin.

12:33.545 --> 12:34.744
Please focus on riding.

12:35.905 --> 12:38.104
I'm on your side.

12:38.104 --> 12:39.665
Freedom is very important.

12:40.025 --> 12:41.624
Don't talk while riding.

12:53.584 --> 12:55.744
Have you heard
of the misattribution of arousal?

12:56.864 --> 12:57.344
What?

12:58.344 --> 12:59.224
(Misattribution of arousal.)

12:59.624 --> 13:02.145
(When one is in a tense environment
with a racing heart,)

13:02.425 --> 13:05.025
(he mistakenly interprets heart-racing
caused by the situation)

13:05.224 --> 13:07.265
(as the illusion of being attracted
by the other person.)

13:26.704 --> 13:27.584
What were you doing?

13:30.425 --> 13:31.785
J-just now...

13:31.785 --> 13:32.305
I'll ride.

13:33.584 --> 13:35.824
Did you feel even a little scared?

13:36.344 --> 13:38.344
I don't trust your driving skills.

13:40.305 --> 13:41.305
But do you know how?

13:42.785 --> 13:43.665
Come on.

13:43.665 --> 13:44.305
You do it.

14:14.704 --> 14:15.344
Miss Lin.

14:16.984 --> 14:17.785
No bosses

14:17.785 --> 14:20.224
want their employees
to know everything about them.

14:20.704 --> 14:21.905
So no matter what you do,

14:22.224 --> 14:23.425
I won't let you join Letao.

14:24.584 --> 14:25.065
Sorry.

14:26.185 --> 14:28.185
I admit I used some tricks.

14:29.344 --> 14:32.945
But doesn't that show how much
I desire and strive for this job?

14:34.305 --> 14:35.704
Don't be fooled
by the misattribution of arousal.

14:36.224 --> 14:37.545
You tried it and should know

14:37.545 --> 14:38.704
it doesn't work, right?

14:40.984 --> 14:41.584
Good night.

14:44.945 --> 14:45.824
You're back.

14:58.545 --> 14:59.464
(Congratulations.)

14:59.545 --> 15:01.624
(Male Lead's fondness
toward you has increased,)

15:01.704 --> 15:03.065
(currently at ten percent.)

15:03.065 --> 15:03.824
(Keep it up!)

15:03.984 --> 15:06.025
(Establish a work connection
with Gao Haiming.)

15:06.744 --> 15:07.785
Why did you deny it?

15:09.425 --> 15:11.425
This proves
the misattribution of arousal works.

15:12.584 --> 15:14.185
Establish a work connection...

15:15.785 --> 15:16.744
How?

15:17.785 --> 15:19.025
He won't even hire me.

15:21.984 --> 15:23.265
What did the book say?

15:23.905 --> 15:26.504
(Seems like joining
a company called Yunsheng.)

15:33.545 --> 15:35.224
Huan'er, don't you go to bed?

15:35.545 --> 15:37.065
I have to work hard

15:37.065 --> 15:38.945
and get into Yunsheng PR Dept.

15:43.665 --> 15:44.425
You work so hard.

15:44.425 --> 15:45.785
I think you'll definitely succeed.

15:47.344 --> 15:48.425
I'm going to bed now.

15:48.864 --> 15:49.344
Good night.

16:18.185 --> 16:19.824
(Due to your great effort,)

16:19.824 --> 16:21.425
(you're awarded with a gift pack.)

16:25.624 --> 16:26.785
No sanitary pads!

16:27.400 --> 16:30.056
(Yunsheng Tower)

16:31.425 --> 16:33.344
First, research
these companies thoroughly.

16:33.425 --> 16:34.864
No need to handle the proposal now.

16:40.104 --> 16:40.945
Wait, what happened?

16:42.945 --> 16:43.624
A bug occurred?

16:44.065 --> 16:44.624
Hello.

16:45.385 --> 16:46.665
(Due to your efforts,)

16:46.824 --> 16:48.665
(you're rewarded with accelerated plot.)

16:48.824 --> 16:51.265
(You have joined Yunsheng
as a PR specialist.)

16:51.265 --> 16:52.065
(Keep it up!)

16:53.385 --> 16:54.265
Ridiculous!

16:55.025 --> 16:55.945
Who needs this kind of

16:55.945 --> 16:57.425
accelerated plot?

16:57.984 --> 16:58.984
If you had any sincerity,

16:58.984 --> 17:01.864
just max out the fondness.

17:02.104 --> 17:03.945
Why didn't you
accelerate plot last night?

17:04.304 --> 17:05.064
I object.

17:05.744 --> 17:06.504
Stand up.

17:07.784 --> 17:08.704
Object to what?

17:08.905 --> 17:10.024
Lin Huan'er, don't forget

17:10.264 --> 17:11.504
you're still on probation.

17:12.064 --> 17:12.704
No.

17:15.080 --> 17:16.072
(Xiang Lingling, PR Dept Manager)

17:17.504 --> 17:18.105
Ma'am Xiang.

17:19.264 --> 17:20.304
I think

17:20.865 --> 17:22.304
these tasks lack challenge.

17:22.425 --> 17:24.425
I want to take over challenging tasks.

17:26.504 --> 17:29.064
First, address me as Ms. Xiang.

17:29.984 --> 17:31.145
Don't try to flatter me.

17:31.945 --> 17:34.224
Second, given your resume,

17:35.064 --> 17:38.304
I think collaborating with these
companies is already challenging to you.

17:40.865 --> 17:44.544
First, Yunsheng already collaborated
with the first two companies.

17:44.704 --> 17:46.704
Just maintain routine relations
with them.

17:47.385 --> 17:48.264
But this one,

17:48.544 --> 17:51.024
Kelv is a recent contact,

17:51.185 --> 17:52.304
producing skincare products.

17:52.704 --> 17:56.625
But as a small brand, they might
get disputes on quality control

17:56.825 --> 17:58.264
and have minor issues.

17:58.704 --> 18:01.464
I think we can use this
to push cooperation.

18:04.064 --> 18:05.905
You've done your prep work well.

18:06.704 --> 18:08.625
Then give me the cooperation proposal
for Kelv

18:08.625 --> 18:09.784
before getting off work.

18:10.185 --> 18:11.024
By myself?

18:12.264 --> 18:13.064
Stand up.

18:15.064 --> 18:15.665
Out!

18:23.585 --> 18:24.984
Lin Huan'er, here you are.

18:24.984 --> 18:25.905
Make 20 copies of this.

18:27.865 --> 18:28.625
Why staring at me?

18:28.625 --> 18:29.385
Go now!

18:29.504 --> 18:30.544
I'm swamped!

18:32.704 --> 18:33.145
Mr. Wang.

18:33.585 --> 18:34.064
Okay.

18:34.625 --> 18:35.665
Let me help, Lin Huan'er.

18:35.865 --> 18:37.345
You... No need.

18:37.345 --> 18:38.185
You are?

18:39.585 --> 18:40.304
Wang Zhen.

18:40.905 --> 18:41.464
Thank you.

18:41.464 --> 18:42.264
You're so kind.

18:44.185 --> 18:46.784
You can still smile
after seeing Xiang Lingling?

18:47.425 --> 18:48.264
Impressive!

18:51.704 --> 18:53.585
I've seen someone meaner than her.

18:53.585 --> 18:54.704
This is nothing.

18:55.464 --> 18:57.625
Ms. Xiang has been in a bad mood lately.

18:58.224 --> 18:59.105
Don't provoke her.

19:00.704 --> 19:01.784
Why is she in a bad mood?

19:02.425 --> 19:05.024
Because the boss ordered her
to secure the Letao order.

19:05.185 --> 19:06.185
She's worried about it.

19:06.825 --> 19:07.984
Letao?

19:08.345 --> 19:09.105
Yes.

19:09.665 --> 19:12.224
Letao is approaching
various PR companies.

19:12.585 --> 19:14.544
I bet something's going on
behind the scenes,

19:14.825 --> 19:16.304
but can't find any leads.

19:20.625 --> 19:21.185
Make way!

19:21.185 --> 19:22.504
Move! Make way!

19:22.585 --> 19:23.744
Go forward!

19:23.744 --> 19:25.024
Don't block my way!

19:25.024 --> 19:25.825
Okay?

19:26.945 --> 19:27.665
So sorry!

19:27.665 --> 19:28.744
Way too rude!

19:28.744 --> 19:29.504
Come on.

19:31.912 --> 19:32.936
(Who's he?)

19:33.192 --> 19:33.928
(Fang Yuan.)

19:34.760 --> 19:35.464
(Fang Yuan?)

19:36.168 --> 19:36.808
(Fang)

19:37.953 --> 19:38.536
(Yuan.)

19:39.304 --> 19:40.456
(Yuan.)

19:40.890 --> 19:41.665
(He's the boss.)

19:41.665 --> 19:42.784
(What?)
God blesses me.

19:43.064 --> 19:44.385
(He's the boss?)
Wish me wealth.

19:44.625 --> 19:46.064
(Boss.)
God blesses me. Thank you.

19:46.064 --> 19:46.792
(Him?)

19:47.208 --> 19:48.385
(Boss.)

19:48.385 --> 19:49.385
Stay calm.

19:51.105 --> 19:51.905
(Okay.)
Okay?

19:52.625 --> 19:54.145
- I...
- What are you doing here?

19:54.385 --> 19:55.784
- This is...
- It's work hours.

19:56.345 --> 19:57.145
- Yes.
- Back to work!

19:57.425 --> 19:58.544
- Got it.
- Absurd!

20:00.105 --> 20:01.264
Listen, everyone.

20:01.425 --> 20:02.224
Year-end is coming.

20:02.425 --> 20:03.704
You must work hard.

20:03.865 --> 20:05.105
Don't waste time!

20:05.304 --> 20:06.984
Upgrade to a big company by year-end!

20:07.105 --> 20:09.704
Get pumped up! Understand?

20:09.945 --> 20:11.264
Okay?

20:11.625 --> 20:12.304
Okay.

20:12.704 --> 20:13.544
- Okay.
- Okay.

20:13.825 --> 20:15.185
Okay?

20:15.905 --> 20:16.905
Okay.

20:16.905 --> 20:17.865
Go for it! Hurry.

20:18.224 --> 20:19.105
Give me the documents.

20:19.385 --> 20:20.105
Be quick.

20:24.385 --> 20:27.345
The last issue of Star and Firefly
performed exceptionally well.

20:27.704 --> 20:30.665
It's currently ranked in the top three
for magazine serialized comic sales.

20:31.064 --> 20:35.345
Besides, we've received
many letters and gifts from fans.

20:35.585 --> 20:37.945
Also, the Market Editorial Department
conducted research.

20:38.264 --> 20:41.784
They found that Star and Firefly
are still everyone's favorite couple.

20:42.585 --> 20:44.945
Although their story is a bit rocky

20:45.304 --> 20:46.585
and it's a mismatched romance,

20:46.984 --> 20:48.865
that's what makes it so captivating.

20:50.704 --> 20:51.825
So...

20:53.984 --> 20:54.945
So...

20:56.064 --> 20:58.064
So the Market Editorial Department
has decided

20:58.425 --> 20:59.704
once the serialization ends,

20:59.825 --> 21:02.105
they'd publish a standalone volume
of Star and Firefly.

21:02.984 --> 21:04.984
Really? Fantastic!

21:05.544 --> 21:06.945
Back when we were selecting topics,

21:06.945 --> 21:07.984
I already

21:07.984 --> 21:09.024
had high hopes for it.

21:09.464 --> 21:10.105
Miss Mengmeng,

21:10.345 --> 21:12.304
you haven't been
in the industry for long,

21:12.304 --> 21:14.945
but you're quite talented
and unconstrained.

21:15.105 --> 21:17.224
It proves my judgment was accurate.

21:18.905 --> 21:19.385
Thank you.

21:20.704 --> 21:24.825
About the proposal and outline
for There He/She Comes,

21:24.825 --> 21:26.345
I've already reviewed them thoroughly.

21:27.145 --> 21:28.064
But I think

21:28.064 --> 21:32.425
if the whole story just revolves
around the friendship between two girls,

21:32.464 --> 21:34.825
it might feel a bit prosaic.

21:35.704 --> 21:36.425
No problem.

21:36.744 --> 21:38.625
I can add romantic storylines for them.

21:39.185 --> 21:40.464
That's exactly what I want.

21:41.105 --> 21:42.984
Then we've reached a consensus.

21:44.185 --> 21:44.865
I'll leave then.

21:47.905 --> 21:48.345
By the way,

21:49.105 --> 21:50.544
submit the draft soon.

21:51.224 --> 21:52.224
Don't worry.

22:01.064 --> 22:02.224
Hello, Huan'er.

22:02.825 --> 22:04.504
Huan'er, you really get me.

22:04.504 --> 22:06.185
My comic is getting a standalone volume.

22:06.185 --> 22:08.585
I was thinking
of going shopping to celebrate.

22:08.744 --> 22:09.464
No problem.

22:09.585 --> 22:10.945
I'll cover everything.

22:14.224 --> 22:15.304
Whoever you are,

22:15.625 --> 22:17.464
get off Huan'er right now!

22:17.984 --> 22:19.425
Don't be so dramatic.

22:19.425 --> 22:20.585
Was I that stingy before?

22:21.064 --> 22:24.105
You always said to spend money wisely,

22:24.105 --> 22:26.304
and to save it for Xiaojue.

22:28.224 --> 22:29.585
I was really foolish before.

22:35.224 --> 22:35.865
Huan'er,

22:35.865 --> 22:36.984
are you okay?

22:36.984 --> 22:38.304
You don't seem quite yourself.

22:38.304 --> 22:39.425
Do you have a fever?

22:39.984 --> 22:40.825
Let's see a doctor.

22:41.585 --> 22:42.345
No need.

22:42.345 --> 22:43.224
Let's have a splurge.

22:43.704 --> 22:44.504
What?

22:45.105 --> 22:46.185
Who's paying it?

22:52.464 --> 22:54.704
Xiaojue loves their clothes the most.

22:57.224 --> 22:57.984
So?

22:58.425 --> 22:59.304
Have you forgotten?

22:59.945 --> 23:01.585
You used your first paycheck

23:01.784 --> 23:03.905
to buy clothes from them for him.

23:10.544 --> 23:11.504
Over here.

23:12.585 --> 23:14.425
This one suits you.

23:14.425 --> 23:15.625
Suits me?

23:16.544 --> 23:17.064
Okay.

23:17.425 --> 23:18.784
How does this look on me?

23:18.784 --> 23:20.064
Very understated. It suits you.

23:54.625 --> 23:55.345
What?

23:56.145 --> 23:57.064
- Take mine.
- Alright.

23:57.145 --> 23:58.105
- Alright.
- You've paid.

23:58.105 --> 23:59.145
- Alright.
- Hope to see you again.

24:00.064 --> 24:01.304
Okay, thanks.

24:01.825 --> 24:02.385
Let's go.

24:05.784 --> 24:06.385
Feels great.

24:06.825 --> 24:07.625
We got the clothes.

24:07.625 --> 24:09.304
Then let's go buy some bags.

24:09.905 --> 24:10.865
Still buying?

24:11.105 --> 24:11.665
Yes.

24:12.185 --> 24:13.425
Mengmeng, have you heard

24:13.425 --> 24:14.865
that bags cure all illness?

24:15.304 --> 24:16.185
And honestly,

24:16.185 --> 24:18.464
money in this world
is like game coins to me.

24:18.464 --> 24:19.464
It is quite useless.

24:19.544 --> 24:21.064
(I've used up my living expenses.)

24:21.224 --> 24:22.264
(Last time, you)

24:22.264 --> 24:23.385
- (transferred me VND 10,000.)
- Who is it?

24:23.385 --> 24:23.825
It's okay.

24:23.825 --> 24:25.064
- Don't mind him.
- (I know you're acting out.)

24:25.064 --> 24:25.784
Let's go buy bags.

24:25.784 --> 24:26.625
(You're living a tough life.)

24:26.625 --> 24:27.185
You...

24:27.185 --> 24:28.264
Stop buying.

24:28.625 --> 24:30.905
Listen, I'll buy you whatever you like.

24:31.224 --> 24:32.784
You'd use up Xiaojue's living expenses

24:32.784 --> 24:33.905
for next month.

24:34.105 --> 24:36.704
Mengmeng, what does he
have anything to do with...

24:39.224 --> 24:40.825
Well, he has something to do with me.

24:41.345 --> 24:42.304
But think about it.

24:42.585 --> 24:45.145
I transferred him
10,000 yuan not long ago.

24:47.064 --> 24:47.984
10,000 yuan?

24:47.984 --> 24:49.185
Yes, that's a lot.

24:49.185 --> 24:50.865
He must be living very comfortably now,

24:50.865 --> 24:51.945
so don't worry.

24:52.224 --> 24:53.105
Let's go buy bags.

24:53.984 --> 24:55.385
Then you still spent so much today?

25:00.145 --> 25:00.665
Let's go.

25:05.064 --> 25:06.224
Is it a photo sticker booth?

25:06.464 --> 25:07.544
(Creating memories)
I haven't taken these in ages.

25:08.345 --> 25:09.024
Let's take a set.

25:09.464 --> 25:09.984
Let's go.

25:11.976 --> 25:12.744
(Prepare for shooting)

25:16.840 --> 25:17.928
(Look up at the camera)

25:23.345 --> 25:24.425
So cute.

25:24.425 --> 25:25.744
So cute.

25:26.312 --> 25:27.665
(Letao Tower)

25:27.665 --> 25:29.544
(Letao's agency market share)
The market share of Beikeke diapers

25:29.825 --> 25:31.464
(in the first half of the year)
under Lovebaby been dropping.

25:32.105 --> 25:33.704
Our agents are barely making any profit.

25:34.504 --> 25:37.105
- Shall we stop importing it?
- Why?

25:37.865 --> 25:38.665
For two reasons.

25:39.064 --> 25:41.865
First, the domestic spokesperson's
reputation has declined.

25:41.865 --> 25:43.464
Second, the product quality

25:43.464 --> 25:45.425
hasn't been upgraded properly.

25:46.905 --> 25:48.064
Any good suggestions?

25:49.105 --> 25:51.425
I suggest we stop importing it

25:51.425 --> 25:53.585
and urge Lovebaby to make adjustments.

25:54.385 --> 25:54.905
I agree.

25:56.984 --> 25:58.984
Well, continue importing it

25:59.585 --> 26:01.304
and increase the promotional budget.

26:03.024 --> 26:03.544
Mr. Huang.

26:04.625 --> 26:05.744
Get these done.

26:05.945 --> 26:09.464
First, remove news related to Beikeke's
original spokesperson and the products.

26:09.825 --> 26:13.105
Second, contact the manufacturer
to prepare for the second-phase upgrade.

26:13.264 --> 26:14.504
Yes, but...

26:14.825 --> 26:15.984
That's it. Meeting adjourned.

26:26.544 --> 26:27.865
Everything's going well.

26:28.304 --> 26:31.024
We're negotiating with raw material
sites and processing plants.

26:31.304 --> 26:32.145
We strive

26:32.145 --> 26:33.464
to secure the lowest price.

26:34.464 --> 26:35.105
Okay.

26:38.064 --> 26:39.825
Beyond the few reliable staff involved,

26:40.185 --> 26:40.905
keep it a secret,

26:41.024 --> 26:41.625
just in case.

26:41.784 --> 26:42.304
Understood.

26:48.645 --> 26:50.941
(Analysis of Market Share
and Strategies)

26:53.744 --> 26:55.024
Need me to send you back?

26:58.105 --> 26:58.665
No, thanks.

27:03.720 --> 27:04.840
(Runner-up Prize, Colorful Dreams
International Comics Contest)

27:04.840 --> 27:05.960
(Zhu Mengmeng, A Bright Future)

27:10.825 --> 27:12.385
Fans are quite curious

27:12.544 --> 27:15.224
what will happen
between Star and Firefly.

27:15.625 --> 27:16.905
Would they part?

27:23.105 --> 27:25.905
Though Star appears cold
and indifferent on the surface,

27:26.264 --> 27:27.945
it doesn't mean he doesn't need light.

27:28.504 --> 27:29.185
Rest assured.

27:29.504 --> 27:32.504
Firefly's tiny light
can still illuminate him.

27:32.704 --> 27:33.945
They will have a happy ending.

27:57.980 --> 28:00.936
(Shoot to Hit)

28:18.464 --> 28:19.264
Haven't you started?

28:20.504 --> 28:21.905
Get lost!

28:23.905 --> 28:26.145
Seems like you have been
too busy with work,

28:26.145 --> 28:27.400
so you can't shoot accurately.

28:29.145 --> 28:29.784
Not at all.

28:30.625 --> 28:33.865
I've recently realized
that during shooting,

28:34.024 --> 28:35.585
the score isn't what matters,

28:35.585 --> 28:36.825
but the process matters.

28:37.345 --> 28:38.224
Well, Mr. Gao,

28:38.504 --> 28:42.665
spare us your business philosophy
theories at the shooting range.

28:44.064 --> 28:45.945
So, how's your work lately?

28:51.464 --> 28:52.744
A bit bumpy, I suppose.

28:53.704 --> 28:54.464
It's fine.

28:54.984 --> 28:56.744
With your capability, that's nothing.

28:58.024 --> 28:58.905
Easier said than done.

28:59.585 --> 29:00.504
In that case,

29:00.825 --> 29:02.224
if you hadn't saved me back then,

29:02.224 --> 29:03.504
I wouldn't even be here today.

29:04.145 --> 29:06.024
It's been years. Can we drop it?

29:06.464 --> 29:07.264
Another round?

29:10.665 --> 29:11.865
Plenty of target paper.

29:12.264 --> 29:13.024
Feel free to shoot.

29:13.145 --> 29:13.464
You!

29:19.400 --> 29:20.520
(Letao Tower)

29:22.704 --> 29:24.145
Miss, who are you looking for?

29:25.464 --> 29:27.865
Hello, I'm a PR specialist
from Yunsheng.

29:27.865 --> 29:29.385
I'm here to talk with Mr. Yu.

29:29.704 --> 29:31.145
Okay, do you have an appointment?

29:31.945 --> 29:33.345
No.

29:33.865 --> 29:35.464
You can't enter without an appointment.

29:36.264 --> 29:37.024
Here's the thing.

29:37.024 --> 29:38.504
I'm from Yunsheng.

29:38.625 --> 29:41.425
Yunsheng and Letao have a collaboration.

29:42.264 --> 29:43.385
I'm afraid it won't work.

29:43.385 --> 29:44.784
It's our company policy.

29:44.784 --> 29:46.345
You can't enter without an appointment.

29:46.345 --> 29:47.385
Sorry, miss.

29:48.704 --> 29:49.264
Alright.

29:50.345 --> 29:50.945
Thanks.

29:58.464 --> 29:59.504
What did she just want?

29:59.865 --> 30:01.744
She said she's a PR specialist
from Yunsheng,

30:01.744 --> 30:03.145
looking for the Marketing Manager.

30:05.224 --> 30:06.425
Clever tricks.

30:07.264 --> 30:08.905
Be alert. Don't ever let her in.

30:09.064 --> 30:09.625
Okay.

30:16.865 --> 30:17.544
Lin Huan'er!

30:18.744 --> 30:19.905
Where's the proposal?

30:20.345 --> 30:20.984
Working on it.

30:21.224 --> 30:23.240
Give me before getting off work,
or quit the job.

30:27.665 --> 30:29.704
(Guess I have to work obediently)

30:29.905 --> 30:30.984
(and proceed step by step.)

30:33.883 --> 30:35.623
(Proposal)

30:50.937 --> 30:52.168
(Three-step Strategy
of Beikeke Upgraded Product Release)

30:52.168 --> 30:55.048
(Letao Cooperation Proposal)

31:01.504 --> 31:02.105
Come in.

31:06.464 --> 31:08.145
Ms. Xiang.

31:08.504 --> 31:10.865
Here's the crisis PR proposal
for Kelv you requested.

31:11.345 --> 31:12.224
It took way too long.

31:12.224 --> 31:12.905
You're fired.

31:12.905 --> 31:13.704
Wait.

31:13.865 --> 31:14.585
Hold on!

31:14.905 --> 31:15.784
Take a look at this.

31:16.072 --> 31:17.689
(Letao Public Relations Proposal)

31:21.345 --> 31:22.345
Letao PR Proposal?

31:24.425 --> 31:26.145
- Who told you to do so?
- Here's the thing.

31:26.145 --> 31:29.145
I heard our company's bidding
for long-term cooperation with Letao,

31:29.625 --> 31:30.744
so I did some research.

31:31.105 --> 31:34.425
I discovered Beikeke under Letao
is losing market share rapidly,

31:34.865 --> 31:37.665
so I thought
this might be an opportunity.

31:38.504 --> 31:39.744
Beikeke?

31:41.185 --> 31:42.105
Mind your own business.

31:42.345 --> 31:43.865
Who told you to do so? Out!

31:43.865 --> 31:46.105
Wait, how about
reviewing my proposal first?

31:46.224 --> 31:47.425
If you approve it,

31:47.425 --> 31:49.064
I can deliver it to Letao now.

31:49.345 --> 31:51.665
Your job is to finish tasks
I told you to,

31:51.665 --> 31:52.585
not to assign me tasks.

31:52.865 --> 31:54.945
Letao isn't your concern. Out!

31:56.504 --> 31:57.304
But my proposal...

32:18.385 --> 32:19.345
(I underestimated her.)

32:19.905 --> 32:21.544
(This NPC isn't easy to deal with.)

32:23.544 --> 32:24.784
(My proposal!)

32:35.145 --> 32:36.825
(She's going to steal my proposal.)

32:44.744 --> 32:45.544
Where are you going?

32:46.105 --> 32:46.744
Go away.

32:46.744 --> 32:47.865
Are you going to Letao?

32:50.544 --> 32:51.585
None of your business.

32:51.825 --> 32:53.304
It is my business.

32:53.865 --> 32:54.945
If you deliver it,

32:54.945 --> 32:56.464
you might fail.

32:56.665 --> 32:57.905
Are you doubting me?

32:57.905 --> 32:59.984
I'm doubting my proposal.

33:02.105 --> 33:04.105
I'm afraid it's not polished enough.

33:04.105 --> 33:06.784
If you present it and jeopardize
the partnership with Letao

33:07.024 --> 33:08.425
and this fails,

33:09.145 --> 33:10.784
I'm afraid it'd implicate you.

33:12.425 --> 33:13.224
I have a solution.

33:13.385 --> 33:14.105
What is it?

33:15.345 --> 33:16.224
I'll deliver it.

33:17.024 --> 33:19.224
Don't worry. If it succeeds,

33:19.385 --> 33:21.625
I'll just say I'm a courier
delivering documents.

33:22.145 --> 33:23.744
If it fails,

33:24.264 --> 33:26.665
you can pin all the blame on me.

33:30.425 --> 33:31.385
Why are you helping me?

33:32.145 --> 33:33.105
To be honest,

33:34.224 --> 33:35.704
I'm really short on cash.

33:36.625 --> 33:38.105
If this works out,

33:38.464 --> 33:41.865
a small bonus from you

33:42.145 --> 33:43.345
would make me very happy.

33:51.264 --> 33:52.345
Bring me good news.

34:03.865 --> 34:05.224
(Letao Sales Optimization Proposal)
Rumors are spreading

34:05.825 --> 34:07.304
that Beikeke has quality issues.

34:07.865 --> 34:09.265
This is deliberate slander.

34:10.504 --> 34:12.064
But if Beikeke gets off the shelves,

34:12.425 --> 34:15.425
it'll severely damage
Lovebaby's entire brand image.

34:15.745 --> 34:16.385
Mr. Gao.

34:16.385 --> 34:18.705
What do you think our PR firm can do?

34:24.624 --> 34:25.305
I suggest

34:25.825 --> 34:28.905
hiring industry experts
for professional evaluation and testing

34:28.905 --> 34:29.984
to clear Beikeke's name

34:30.504 --> 34:31.865
and launching upgraded products.

34:33.064 --> 34:34.464
After restoring its reputation,

34:34.745 --> 34:37.425
Beikeke will return with new packaging

34:37.624 --> 34:38.624
and superior quality.

34:39.104 --> 34:39.825
Understood.

34:40.144 --> 34:40.745
Rest assured.

34:41.104 --> 34:42.865
We'll handle this properly.

34:43.584 --> 34:44.425
Thank you then.

34:52.840 --> 34:53.586
(Letao Tower)

35:02.945 --> 35:04.984
Hello, I came yesterday.

35:05.144 --> 35:06.104
I have an appointment.

35:08.305 --> 35:08.905
Guards!

35:20.272 --> 35:23.255
♪Entwined worries linger♪

35:24.464 --> 35:27.235
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

35:29.136 --> 35:35.049
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

35:36.846 --> 35:39.906
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

35:41.072 --> 35:44.524
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

35:45.520 --> 35:51.046
♪Until the world's end♪

35:53.456 --> 35:57.252
♪If I could♪

35:57.840 --> 36:00.656
♪Keep loving you♪

36:01.680 --> 36:04.080
♪Hearing two hearts♪

36:04.080 --> 36:08.996
♪Beating together♪

36:09.968 --> 36:13.832
♪If I could♪

36:13.832 --> 36:17.072
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

36:18.128 --> 36:25.453
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

36:26.512 --> 36:29.456
♪Entwined worries linger♪

36:30.704 --> 36:33.456
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

36:35.312 --> 36:41.092
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

36:43.024 --> 36:46.049
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

36:47.294 --> 36:50.960
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

36:51.728 --> 36:57.575
♪Until the world's end♪

36:59.568 --> 37:03.472
♪If I could♪

37:04.080 --> 37:06.832
♪Keep loving you♪

37:07.888 --> 37:10.224
♪Hearing two hearts♪

37:10.224 --> 37:15.184
♪Beating together♪

37:16.176 --> 37:19.739
♪If I could♪

37:19.739 --> 37:23.440
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

37:24.432 --> 37:31.664
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪
